":"<p>I usually <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> by bus.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":8464,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I pick up my clothes and start to <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":8465,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> at 6:00, then I catch the bus home.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":8466,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> early every morning when I hear my alarm.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":8467,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We need to <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> because there's no food in the fridge.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":8468,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>After I finish school, I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> and do my homework.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}